From 6c6bc69d5a0c54a1a35e21a62a318318de669a48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stefan <46031448+StefanPetersTM@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:57:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] phy: add bounded M2SDR uplink timing compensation

Port the default-off PRACH stage-1 search/TA correction and dynamic non-PRACH context-edge offset used to recover Msg1 and Msg3 on the CP3114 M2SDR path. The disabled path preserves upstream timing and hot-path behavior; bounded capture controls remain off by default. Refs CP2064, CP2129, CP3104, CP3114.
